{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A border town in chaos\u2014fields lie barren, beggars collapse on the streets, while bandits and tax collectors alike prey on the weak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the ruined tavern, only broken chairs and dust remain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two kingdoms both claim this land, and the winds of war are blowing toward the town. A letter from the village elder arrives: your grandfather\u2019s tavern has been seized. You decide to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aA Kingdom of Soil\u300b</strong> is a pixel-art medieval RPG and management adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b0264ffbedd021363a7ddc2beecf1c77.poster.avif?t=1760762737\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b0264ffbedd021363a7ddc2beecf1c77.webm?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b0264ffbedd021363a7ddc2beecf1c77.mp4?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a returning heir, rebuilding your family\u2019s legacy amidst turmoil, uncovering buried secrets, and forging your own legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the main story unfolds, you will uncover the mysteries of the tavern and the town, while freely choosing your own way of life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everyday Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plow the soil, sow and harvest, fish and hunt\u2026 The land is not only your means of survival, but the very foundation of your rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/d7e8ac7a2add9dfc0bf72820a15ef946.poster.avif?t=1760762737\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/d7e8ac7a2add9dfc0bf72820a15ef946.webm?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/d7e8ac7a2add9dfc0bf72820a15ef946.mp4?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft and Influence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge weapons, cook meals, brew ale, craft works of art\u2014every skill can earn you wealth or favors.<br>Deal with all kinds of people using negotiation, intimidation, deception, or charm. Your reputation can open doors\u2014or create enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/2349e37a1c4ef4ba14c3e343f753c1e7.poster.avif?t=1760762737\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/2349e37a1c4ef4ba14c3e343f753c1e7.webm?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/2349e37a1c4ef4ba14c3e343f753c1e7.mp4?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/86cdb4f5ac2d27d24b317bfba30b371d.poster.avif?t=1760762737\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/86cdb4f5ac2d27d24b317bfba30b371d.webm?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/86cdb4f5ac2d27d24b317bfba30b371d.mp4?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bonds and Companionship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though morals decay and society crumbles, you may still form true bonds with the townsfolk, build a family, and even grow old together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During festivals, the tavern fills with light. Even with war looming, people will still raise their cups and celebrate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to thrive in the medieval world?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak, steal, and assassinate\u2014plan daring heists in the dark with your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One successful strike may make you rich, but it may also turn everyone\u2019s eyes against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a righteous outlaw, or a ruthless brigand? The <strong>choice</strong> is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuild Your Tavern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFriend! Have another drink!\u201d Stoke the fire, repair rooms, refresh the menu, hear new stories, take on quests, and hire help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the tavern reopens, many will stop by\u2014some bringing wealth and songs, others bringing plots and danger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power and Intrigue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the clinking of cups, nobles and politicians will arrive at your tavern.<br>Some truly strive for peace, seeking to prevent war and improve lives.<br>Others are deceitful and greedy, ignoring suffering while clinging to the old order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the table, will you listen and assist, subtly shaping events?<br>Or remain silent, seeking only to endure these troubled times?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Final Choice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finally recover your grandfather\u2019s recipe,<strong> </strong>the <u><i><strong>Legendary Brew</strong></i></u><strong> </strong>returns to the world<strong>.</strong><br>The old tavern once again becomes a beacon in chaos, gathering both hearts and ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the glow of cups and candlelight, there is wealth and song, but also schemes and suspicion.<br>And now, fate rests upon your shoulders:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you carry forward the old family name, letting its legacy echo in every cup?<br>Or sever the past entirely, and carve a new epic of your own?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991390?t=1760762737","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991390?t=1760762737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/3b723388fcad9b52c620624c42e760cfd662b9ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760762737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/3b723388fcad9b52c620624c42e760cfd662b9ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760762737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Special Announcement</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development of <i>A Kingdom of Soil</i> began in May 2025, and the creator is now working full-time on the project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community to get the latest updates and behind-the-scenes news:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc26 Dev (X/Twitter): <u><i><strong>@NicoDocci</strong></i></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 Official (X/Twitter):<strong><i><u>@AKingdomofSoil</u></i></strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac Discord: <strong><i><u></u></i></strong></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A border town in chaos\u2014fields lie barren, beggars collapse on the streets, while bandits and tax collectors alike prey on the weak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the ruined tavern, only broken chairs and dust remain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two kingdoms both claim this land, and the winds of war are blowing toward the town. A letter from the village elder arrives: your grandfather\u2019s tavern has been seized. You decide to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aA Kingdom of Soil\u300b</strong> is a pixel-art medieval RPG and management adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b0264ffbedd021363a7ddc2beecf1c77.poster.avif?t=1760762737\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b0264ffbedd021363a7ddc2beecf1c77.webm?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/b0264ffbedd021363a7ddc2beecf1c77.mp4?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a returning heir, rebuilding your family\u2019s legacy amidst turmoil, uncovering buried secrets, and forging your own legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the main story unfolds, you will uncover the mysteries of the tavern and the town, while freely choosing your own way of life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everyday Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plow the soil, sow and harvest, fish and hunt\u2026 The land is not only your means of survival, but the very foundation of your rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/d7e8ac7a2add9dfc0bf72820a15ef946.poster.avif?t=1760762737\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/d7e8ac7a2add9dfc0bf72820a15ef946.webm?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/d7e8ac7a2add9dfc0bf72820a15ef946.mp4?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft and Influence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge weapons, cook meals, brew ale, craft works of art\u2014every skill can earn you wealth or favors.<br>Deal with all kinds of people using negotiation, intimidation, deception, or charm. Your reputation can open doors\u2014or create enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/2349e37a1c4ef4ba14c3e343f753c1e7.poster.avif?t=1760762737\" width=1170 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/2349e37a1c4ef4ba14c3e343f753c1e7.webm?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/2349e37a1c4ef4ba14c3e343f753c1e7.mp4?t=1760762737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991390/extras/86cdb4f5ac2d27d24b317bfba30b371d.poster.avif?t=1760762737\" width=1170 heigh